</span>:  I heard there's a Pisco Sour Day in Lima!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">John</span>: Yes, they have a day to celebrate their cocktail.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Tourist#2</span>: Wow! When is that event?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">John</span>: Hmm ... I'm not sure. I can google that and get back to you.", "id": 3, "time": "33800", "image": "engenn4le15ob07re2img03.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn4le15ob07re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn4le15ob07re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}]}]}